# Config Schema

## pool_config.yaml Structure
routing:
  method: kmeans | prefill
  checkpoint: path to .pkl or .pt
  tolerance: 0.0-1.0 (default 0.20)
  embed_model: HF model name (kmeans)
  embed_mode: api | local (kmeans)
  embed_api_base: URL (kmeans)
  encoder: HF model path (prefill)
  encoder_server: URL (prefill)
  training_mode: per_model | single | auto (prefill)

models:
  - name: unique identifier
    display_name: human-readable
    litellm_model: litellm model string
    cost_per_m_input_tokens: float
    cost_per_m_output_tokens: float

## Validation
- Use pydantic models from config.py for validation
- All configs load via load_config() function
- Never parse YAML manually — always go through PoolConfig.model_validate()
